 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hook1",
   "text": "Rush hour. You're in the tunnel. In front of you, a double-decker bus. Then it stops.",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "text": "It's stuck. The roof is wedged under the ceiling. And fifty passengers are staring at you. What do you do?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong1",
   "text": "Most drivers think: push it! Bumper on bumper. Full throttle!",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong2",
   "text": "The bus pops out of the tunnel like a cork from a bottle. And you fly right after it.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong3",
   "text": "You land on its roof. And the bus just drives on. Congratulations: you're the top deck now. Next stop: everywhere.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong4",
   "text": "Exam failed.",
   "gap": 1.15
  },
  {
   "id": "right1",
   "text": "Here's how you do it properly.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "right2",
   "text": "Engine off. Hazards on. Then knock on the driver's window, and whisper one word: tyres.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "right3",
   "text": "Pssssst. A little air out of every tyre. The bus sinks. Just five centimetres.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "right4",
   "text": "And it rolls free! Out of the tunnel, into the sunshine.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "right5",
   "text": "Then the passengers pump the tyres back up. Fifty people. One big breath each.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right6",
   "text": "And for you, a golden ticket. Free rides. Forever.",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "right7",
   "text": "Exam passed.",
   "gap": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "text": "Next exam question: a train made of shopping trolleys, at the level crossing. Follow, so you don't miss it.",
   "gap": 1.2
  }
 ],
